  ;; ============================================================
  ;; WIRES (Net connections described textually)
  ;; ============================================================
  ;; Note: In KiCad, open this schematic and draw wires to connect:
  ;; - J1:VBUS  -> U1:VBUS  (through C1, C2 decoupling)
  ;; - J1:GND   -> U1:GND   (common ground)
  ;; - J1:CC1   -> U1:CC1
  ;; - J1:CC2   -> U1:CC2
  ;; - U1:VOUT_EN -> Power MOSFET gate or direct VBUS switch
  ;; - U1:I2C_SDA -> R1 pull-up -> J3:SDA
  ;; - U1:I2C_SCL -> R2 pull-up -> J3:SCL
  ;; - U1:INT   -> optional INT header pin
  ;; - VBUS_OUT -> R3 -> D1 (LED indicator)
  ;; - VBUS_OUT -> C3 -> J2 (screw terminal output)

